 🥗 AI Smart Diet & Fitness Recommendation System

A full-stack Django-based Diet & Fitness Management Platform that connects Customers, Dieticians, and Admin with smart health tracking, personalized diet/workout plans, payment integration, progress monitoring, OTP verification, and chatbot assistance.

---

 🚀 Key Features

 👤 Customer Module
- OTP-based secure registration & email verification
- Browse dieticians and chat in real-time
- Join free/paid diet plans
- Request personalized custom diet plans
- Purchase workout plans
- Track daily food intake
- BMI, BMR & SMR health analysis
- View nutrition reports & progress tracking
- Give feedback and ratings

---

 🧑‍⚕️ Dietician Module
- Register with license verification
- Create free/paid diet plans
- Upload PDF diet resources
- Manage custom diet requests
- Add nutritional food database
- Create structured workout plans with videos/images
- Track joined customer progress
- Chat with customers

---

 🛠 Admin Module
- Approve / reject dieticians
- Manage customers and dieticians
- Monitor diet/workout plans
- View system-wide feedback analytics
- Track all joined plans and progress reports

---

 🧠 Smart Health Features
- BMI Calculator
- BMR Calculator
- SMR Analysis
- Daily nutrition intake evaluation
- Diet completion percentage tracking
- Personalized health progress insights

---

 💬 Communication System
- Real-time Customer ↔ Dietician chat
- Automated OTP & email notifications
- Password auto-generation after verification

---

 💳 Payment Simulation
- Paid diet/workout plan purchase flow
- Access control after successful payment

---

 🤖 AI Integration
- Python Chatbot Support
- Smart health assistance automation

---

 🛠 Tech Stack

Backend: Django, Python  
Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Bootstrap  
Database: SQLite  
Authentication: Django Auth + OTP Verification  
Email Service: SMTP  
File Handling: PDF / Image / Video Uploads

---

 🔥 Highlights
✔ Multi-user Role-Based System  
✔ Real-Time Chat  
✔ Health Tracking Analytics  
✔ Diet + Workout Marketplace  
✔ Secure OTP Authentication  
✔ Full CRUD Operations  
✔ Payment Workflow Simulation  

